<title>UK: SALOMON UPS OCTOBER 2002 FRN TO 125 MILLION STG.</title>
<headline>SALOMON UPS OCTOBER 2002 FRN TO 125 MILLION STG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been</p>
<p>increased to 125 million stg from 100 million stg, lead manager Salomon</p>
<p>Brothers International said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SALOMON INC</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +37.5 BP  PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.68     FULL FEES   0.30</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB	 REOFFER    99.68</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
